 "origem": "gringa: México (espanhol) https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/news/nasa-isro-mission-maps-mexico-city-sinking/ (NISAR, viral no México) + Ángel de la Independencia, 14 degraus a mais desde 1910",
 "titulo": "This monument needed 14 new steps. The city sank 😳 #howitworks #shorts",
 "capa": "THE CITY IS SINKING",
 "descripcion": "Mexico City sinks up to about an inch a month in some spots. The reason is under the streets.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#howitworks #engineering #mexicocity #science #shorts",
 "tags": [
